    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "今日、雑誌の発売日でしょ\r\nどんな感じの評判か、ふゆの名前で検索してるの",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あ、安心しなさい\r\nいいねなんて残さないで、ちゃんとスクショしてるから",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "調べてるって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "何よ、当然じゃない\r\n市場調査は大事でしょ、商売なんだから",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ちゃ～んと話題になってるか、調べなきゃ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、しっかりしてるな……\r\n一応、それをやるのは、俺の仕事なんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それも当然、わかってんに決まってんでしょ\r\nしっかりやってもらわなきゃ困るわよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "でも、ふゆ自身が評判を見るのも大事じゃない\r\n世間にふゆがどう思われてるかって",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……確かに、冬優子の言うことは正しいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、無理はしすぎるなよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
