    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どれどれ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（もともとのファン、他の記事目当てに雑誌を見た人\r\n色んな反応があるな……）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "『すっごく\r\n可愛かったです』",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "『かっこよかったです』",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "（『この子、\r\n性格悪そう』）",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020120,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふふ、当然よね！\r\nいいこと言うじゃない！",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そんな感じの、他にもあるでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……『もっとふゆちゃんの可愛いピンナップが見たい』\r\n『ふゆちゃんの可愛さが憧れ！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "いいじゃない！　ほら、もっと！\r\nふゆを褒め称える言葉を読み上げなさい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……これ、俺が読まないでも、\r\n自分で探せば見つかるんじゃ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふふ、あんたの口から聞く方が気分がいいのよ\r\nアイドルの精神衛生管理も仕事でしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そういうことか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ほら、まだ終わりなんて言ってないでしょ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もっともっと、\r\nふゆの可愛さを賞賛する言葉をよこしなさいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
