    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、でも冬優子が本当に嫌なら……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020240,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……ったく！　全然？　不本意だけど？\r\nあんたはふゆのプロデューサーだし……",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020250,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "真逆のことをするから、\r\nギャップで可愛さが引き立つことも、あるかもだし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800402/2018004020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004020260,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "しょうがないから、\r\nあんたの計画に乗ってあげる。感謝しなさい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
